{"step_index":303,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-20T15:22:52Z","content":"{{ CHECKPOINT 3 }}\n **The earlier parts of this conversation have been truncated due to its long length. The following content summarizes the truncated context so that you may continue your work. **\n\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. bây giừo tôi được giao làm một hệ thống web để thể hiện khung kiến trúc số nay, theo những gì đề ra thì tôi nên làm 1 web như thế nào,\nphương án 1 là web thể hiện ra dữ liệu theo khung kts thôi\nphương án 2 làm 2 web: 1 web quản trị để nhập nội dung tham chiếu lên kts, 1 web để hiện thị cho lãnh đạo hoặc người cần xem\nphương án 3 : bạn hãy đề xuất thêm ý tưởng. \nvà khi làm web chúng ta cần dựa theo cái sườn nào để làm, nội dung chính nào cần phải focus để thể hiện đúng quyết định.\n2. tiep tuc\n3. C:\\Delta Force\\v4. ten mien - snnmt - bo_sung_CSDL_theo_ND278_15.9.2026 (1) xem xét tích hợp file này\n4. dotnet run\n5. có\n6. trang load chậm quá\n7. bật lại\n8. đọc thêm project tôi vừa thêm vào và cho biết nó dùng những thư viện ngôn ngữ gì. sau đó sửa lại dự án Kiến truc số của chúng ta theo dạng ngôn ngữ thư viện của project đó để có thể có trường hợp tích hợp vào trong nó, đây là link:C:\\Delta chung\\NQ57_github\n9. hãy sửa tất cả luôn đi xong chạy lên cho tôi\n10. ko cần login gì tôi muốn làm y chang dự án của chúng ta đây này nhưng chạy bằng  ASP.NET Core MVC (C# .NET 7.0)\n\n# Previous Session Summary:\n# Session Continuation Summary\n\n## 1. Outstanding User Requests\n\n- **Migrate Admin Features to ASP.NET Core MVC (Without Login)** \n  - **Status**: IMPLEMENTATION\n  - **User Intent**: \"ko cần login gì tôi muốn làm y chang dự án của chúng ta đây này nhưng chạy bằng ASP.NET Core MVC (C# .NET 7.0)\"\n  - **Details**: The user wants to perfectly replicate the remaining features from the Next.js project (Admin Dashboard, CRUD for Systems and Tasks) into the new ASP.NET Core MVC project. Authentication/Login can be completely skipped.\n\n## 2. User Knowledge\n\n- **Target Tech Stack Migration**: The user provided a reference project at `C:\\Delta Force\\NQ57_github` and requested that the *Khung Kiến trúc Số (KTS)* project be completely rewritten to match its tech stack so it can be integrated later. The reference stack is: C# 11, .NET 7.0, ASP.NET Core MVC, Entity Framework Core 7, and SQL Server.\n- **Data Integration Rules**: The user provided an Excel file `C:\\Delta Force\\v4. ten mien - snnmt - bo_sung_CSDL_theo_ND278_15.9.2026 (1).xlsx` containing 379 systems for the Department of Agriculture. (Note: We imported this into the old Node.js/SQLite DB. We may want to seed this into the new SQL Server DB eventually).\n- **Authentication**: The user explicitly stated \"ko cần login gì\" (no login needed) for the new .NET Admin section.\n\n## 3. Work Accomplished\n\n- **Node.js/Next.js Project (Archived)**: \n  - Fully completed the Next.js UI pages (Portal, Admin, Login).\n  - Wrote a Node.js script to parse and import 379 systems from the provided Excel file into the SQLite database.\n  - Implemented pagination on the Next.js `HienTrang` portal page to fix severe UI lag caused by rendering ~400 cards simultaneously.\n- **.NET 7 MVC Migration (Active)**:\n  - Created an implementation plan artifact for the rewrite, which was auto-approved.\n  - Scaffolded a new ASP.NET Core MVC project at `C:\\Delta Force\\KtsVinhLongNet\\KtsVinhLong`.\n  - Installed EF Core 7 packages and `dotnet-ef` global tool.\n  - Created C# Models (`KhungKts`, `DonVi`, `HeThongSo`, `NhiemVu`, `User`) and configured `KtsDbContext`.\n  - Configured `appsettings.json` to use SQL Server LocalDB (`(localdb)\\mssqllocaldb`).\n  - Successfully generated and applied the `InitialCreate` EF Migration.\n  - Wrote `DbInitializer.cs` and modified `Program.cs` to seed initial sample data on startup.\n  - Implemented `PortalController` and Razor Views (`_Layout`, `_ViewStart`, `_ViewImports`, `Index`, `HienTrang`), using Tailwind CSS via CDN for rapid styling identical to the Next.js version.\n  - Started implementing the Admin UI by creating `_AdminLayout.cshtml`.\n\n## 4. Model Knowledge\n\n- **Architecture Shift**: We have completely abandoned the Node.js/Next.js/Prisma/SQLite stack. The active project is now ASP.NET Core MVC (.NET 7.0) with Entity Framework Core 7 and SQL Server LocalDB.\n- **UI Paradigm**: Instead of React components (Ant Design, React Flow, Recharts), we are using Razor Views (`.cshtml`), Tailwind CSS via CDN, and vanilla JS/jQuery libraries (e.g., Chart.js).\n- **Environment**: To run the active project, execute `dotnet run` inside `C:\\Delta Force\\KtsVinhLongNet\\KtsVinhLong`.\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n**Edited/Created Files (in `C:\\Delta Force\\KtsVinhLongNet\\KtsVinhLong\\`)**:\n- `Models/DonVi.cs`, `Models/HeThongSo.cs`, `Models/KhungKts.cs`, `Models/NhiemVu.cs`, `Models/User.cs`: EF Core entity definitions.\n- `Data/KtsDbContext.cs`: EF Core Database Context.\n- `Data/DbInitializer.cs`: Seeds default data (1 DonVi, 4 HeThongSo) if DB is empty.\n- `Program.cs`: Registered DbContext (SQL Server) and added initialization logic on startup.\n- `appsettings.json`: Added `DefaultConnection` string for LocalDB.\n- `Controllers/PortalController.cs`: Handles `/Portal/Index` and `/Portal/HienTrang`.\n- `Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml`: Public portal layout using Tailwind CDN.\n- `Views/Shared/_AdminLayout.cshtml`: Admin layout with sidebar using Tailwind CDN (just created).\n- `Views/Portal/Index.cshtml`, `Views/Portal/HienTrang.cshtml`: Public portal views.\n\n**Viewed Files**:\n- `C:\\Delta Force\\NQ57_github\\PropertyRental\\PropertyRental.csproj`: Read to determine the target migration tech stack (.NET 7, EF Core SqlServer).\n\n## 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n\n- **Current State**: I just finished creating `_AdminLayout.cshtml` for the .NET MVC project to mimic the old Next.js admin layout.\n- **Next Steps**:\n  1. Create `Controllers/AdminController.cs` with routes for `Index` (Dashboard), `HeThong` (Systems list), and `NhiemVu` (Tasks list). *Do not add `[Authorize]` attributes since the user requested no login.*\n  2. Create Razor Views for the Admin section:\n     - `Views/Admin/Index.cshtml` (Dashboard with Chart.js to replace Recharts)\n     - `Views/Admin/HeThong.cshtml` (CRUD table for Systems)\n     - `Views/Admin/NhiemVu.cshtml` (CRUD table for Tasks)\n  3. Ensure `DbInitializer.cs` has some `NhiemVu` data so the Admin views aren't completely empty.\n  4. Run `dotnet run` in `C:\\Delta Force\\KtsVinhLongNet\\KtsVinhLong` and provide the user with the localhost link.\n\nYou have the 5 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789831851459]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Lnog/.gemini/antigravity/brain/0c724d03-995b-41e5-b753-c6096ba91ae8/.user_uploaded/media_1789831851459.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-19T15:31:01Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: de_xuat_web_kts]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Lnog/.gemini/antigravity/brain/0c724d03-995b-41e5-b753-c6096ba91ae8/de_xuat_web_kts.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-19T15:50:22Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: implementation_plan]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Lnog/.gemini/antigravity/brain/0c724d03-995b-41e5-b753-c6096ba91ae8/implementation_plan.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-20T15:12:58Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: task]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Lnog/.gemini/antigravity/brain/0c724d03-995b-41e5-b753-c6096ba91ae8/task.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-20T15:15:08Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: tong_hop_noi_dung]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Lnog/.gemini/antigravity/brain/0c724d03-995b-41e5-b753-c6096ba91ae8/tong_hop_noi_dung.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-19T15:34:53Z\n\n# Running Background Tasks\nThe following background tasks were running at the time this checkpoint was created.\nUse the manage_task tool to interact with them (e.g. to kill them or check their status).\n\n{\n  \"taskId\":  \"0c724d03-995b-41e5-b753-c6096ba91ae8/task-226\",\n  \"toolName\":  \"run_comm